Evidence required: Name the file and cite the signature, decorator, declaration or statement that carries the misplaced responsibility, its package or origin, and the layer kind it belongs to.
Out of scope: import direction and layer-dependency rules, which are checked symbolically.

## Layer model
Style: nestjs. Layers are listed inner to outer: a layer may depend on the layers listed before it.
- domain (kind: domain; may depend on: no other layer): src/domain/**, src/core/**, src/entities/**, src/models/**
